  "decision_conditions": [
    "LAND USE (COMPLIANCE): The 5 additional 'Brothers Rooms' hereby approved shall only be occupied as Class C2 residential institution accommodation under the Town and Country Planning (Use Classes) Order 1987 (as amended). The rooms shall not be occupied as any other form of residential accommodation without the formal planning consent of the Local Planning Authority.\r\n\r\nREASON: Necessary for the Local Planning Authority to control the use of these additional rooms, to ensure that the use of these rooms is line with the planning use of the existing ‘Brothers Rooms’ accommodation within the site, and to prevent the use of these rooms as independent Class C3 dwellings without the prior written consent fo the Local Planning Authority."
